 your bonded one and navigate the competing visions of Mal and Weyl, two Etre leaders with incompatible plans for Orbis and Lucent, the structured light that forms this world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together a non-linear story about love, awakening, and responsibility as you follow Atel\u2019s echoes and map your entanglement with the World Mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/0e0516cef1a53d9767680f5bfde8bad9.poster.avif?t=1770679931\" width=800 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/0e0516cef1a53d9767680f5bfde8bad9.webm?t=1770679931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/0e0516cef1a53d9767680f5bfde8bad9.mp4?t=1770679931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/88c68f87fef080a4520eb1495c7eb3c4.poster.avif?t=1770679931\" width=800 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/88c68f87fef080a4520eb1495c7eb3c4.webm?t=1770679931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/88c68f87fef080a4520eb1495c7eb3c4.mp4?t=1770679931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","developers":["Studio Lifeforms"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"he